efinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"自适应设计是否计划：否\n样本量再估计是否计划：否\n期中分析是否计划：否\nSRC是否计划：否\nDMC是否计划：是","quote_sha256":"e10a8d8a6f45953940dc44db993ce4fb5844ebb3a5b49c85365d79e0b89c8c97","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_monitoring_flags"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂薄膜衣片QD×52周双盲双模拟；主要比较R3A-BPH101 50mg组 vs 安慰剂组第52周IPSS较基线变化。","quote_sha256":"e81e4ce8fda7d6251ddfcb3babaea0b23efe2179810564e4cf02f9879e6d9dd9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"剂量与给药方案：R3A-BPH101（口服β3肾上腺素受体激动剂）：50mg薄膜衣片QD整片吞服，连续52周；漏服当日不补服。","quote_sha256":"48704c5e115392299940f1e9dfc47b2c1e4e66bde83f65367c2d96e29e56ac8f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_dosing"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"试验干预：R3A-BPH101（口服β3肾上腺素受体激动剂）50mg QD连续52周；维持稳定基础护理与定期前列腺监测。","quote_sha256":"4f7a01ea29fa285030675f951584e9a4d6405f67f49bcc2071d154e3d5798ce7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"研究人群概述：50-85岁男性BPH伴中重度LUTS患者（IPSS≥13，QoL≥3）；前列腺体积30-80mL；既往未行BPH手术，未使用或已停用α1阻滞剂/5α还原酶抑制剂足够洗脱期。","quote_sha256":"36f97a188c407c6f6affc79cc78e41d7fe5bc02306aa2d2f2c8ec4e83f208c02","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_population"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_packet_421","ev_design","ev_purpose","ev_arms","ev_primary","ev_sample","ev_estimand","ev_analysis","ev_monitoring_flags","ev_placebo","ev_dosing","ev_intervention","ev_population"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":12},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充效应量假设（组间差异2.0分、标准差5.0分）的临床与统计学依据来源，并在统计分析计划中细化缺失数据处理、多重性控制顺序与敏感性分析规则","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_421_effect_assumption_basis","missing_source_classes":["效应量假设依据文件（既往研究或文献总结）","统计分析计划（SAP）"],"target":"4.2.1 确证性设计与假设依据"}],"heading":"确证性设计与假设依据","missing_source_classes":["效应量假设依据文件（既往研究或文献总结）","统计分析计划（SAP）"],"proposal_text":"本研究为随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心III期确证性研究，内在研究目的为确证性评价。目标研究人群为50-85岁男性良性前列腺增生伴中重度下尿路症状患者，IPSS总评分≥13分且QoL≥3分，前列腺体积30-80mL，既往未接受BPH手术治疗，未使用或已停用α1阻滞剂/5α还原酶抑制剂并满足洗脱要求。受试者按1:1比例随机分配至R3A-BPH101 50mg组或安慰剂组；R3A-BPH101为口服β3肾上腺素受体激动剂，采用50mg薄膜衣片每日一次整片吞服，连续52周，安慰剂组接受安慰剂薄膜衣片每日一次，给药周期相同，采用双盲双模拟，治疗期间维持稳定基础护理与定期前列腺监测。主要终点为治疗第52周IPSS总评分较基线的变化，主要比较R3A-BPH101 50mg组与安慰剂组第52周IPSS较基线的组间差异。估计目标采用治疗策略，以mITT人群第52周IPSS总评分较基线的变化为估计对象，不因依从性、合并BPH用药或脱落改变归属，缺失值主分析采用MMRM。样本量假设为第52周IPSS较基线变化组间差异2.0分、标准差5.0分，双侧α=0.05，把握度90%，每组290例可评价；按20%脱落率计算，计划入组726例，每组363例。主要分析采用ANCOVA，协变量包括基线IPSS与中心分层，在mITT主分析集进行；关键次要终点按固定顺序控制多重性；安全性在Safety集进行描述性分析；补充混合模型与插补敏感性分析。本研究不计划自适应设计，不进行样本量再估计，也不设置期中分析。","rationale":"正文依据已确认研究事实撰写，涵盖随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心III期确证性设计，R3A-BPH101 50mg与安慰剂对照及52周每日一次给药，主要终点为第52周IPSS总评分较基线变化，样本量按组间差异2.0分、标准差5.0分、双侧α=0.05、把握度90%和20%脱落率计算，估计目标为治疗策略并采用MMRM，主要分析为ANCOVA。医学作者需核对效应量假设的临床依据来源、1:1分配比例与中心分层的正式规定，并统一入选标准与洗脱要求中关于5α还原酶抑制剂停用时间的表述。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（确证性设计与假设依据）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、估计目标、期中分析、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_44946511b73cff1e","section_number":"4.2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:87ce7972b959cef0f3a2a8c8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fa51b8e0f4b0c3","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260929214156_6dd8e933","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_dcedb3760172c9fc:full-draft:87ce7972b959cef0f3a2a8c8","quote":"章节编号=4.3\n章节标题=随机化\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=采用随机化分配。","quote_sha256":"abd83d64e0bfdfb16ad81aba49b0e40b94a606e3750c69b36e81d81b7bc970d2","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:87ce7972b959cef0f3a2a8c8","span_id":"ev_packet_43"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心III期确证性研究","quote_sha256":"b54023d287ba13d7e981a0107b17ac83e4cdc7d00339373c8b4b93062e32b7df","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"试验组与对照组：R3A-BPH101 50mg组；安慰剂组","quote_sha256":"0c9d63cd3e0dc9a7384b59d4751f963d57ba8e043db6524addbe016c55028e27","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_arms"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"假设第52周IPSS较基线变化组间差异2.0分（SD 5.0），α=0.05双侧、把握度90%，每组290例可评价；按20%脱落率入组726例（每组363例）。","quote_sha256":"a614ad49604f64d0a6b1dc2f7b9bb1abc98cfd8f78605df604976f42b255c4e8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_sample"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"治疗策略（treatment policy）：mITT人群第52周IPSS总评分较基线的变化，不因依从性、合并BPH用药或脱落改变归属；缺失值主分析采用MMRM。","quote_sha256":"488833ef9a0ab4b300179c2cbb097a199b1e955231167830a594234b7a1f24e0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_estimand"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"访视策略：筛选（V-6~0周）：IPSS/QoL、尿流率、前列腺体积（MRI/B超）、PSA、实验室；基线（V0）：随机、首次给药；治疗期每12周访视（V1-V5）：IPSS/QoL、给药依从性、AE；第26与52周加测尿流率与PVR；安全性随访（末次给药后4周）。","quote_sha256":"7ec8367fc7cda85923fb7a6766ba5f5cab1b287d881cb924726671b8883ce857","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_visits"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_packet_43","ev_design","ev_arms","ev_sample","ev_estimand","ev_visits"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充随机化方案或统计设计中的随机化实施说明，明确随机化系统与实施载体、随机序列生成方法、区组设置、分层因素与分配隐藏方式","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_43_randomization_spec","missing_source_classes":["随机化方案/随机化实施说明","统计分析计划中的随机化与分层设定"],"target":"4.3 随机化"}],"heading":"随机化","missing_source_classes":["随机化方案/随机化实施说明","统计分析计划中的随机化与分层设定"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用随机化方法将受试者分配至R3A-BPH101 50mg组或安慰剂组，两组按1:1比例分配，计划入组726例，每组363例。随机化于基线访视（V0）实施，受试者在完成筛选期评估并确认符合入选标准后接受随机，并首次给药。研究为多中心、平行组设计，随机化分配用于保障两组受试者在基线特征与疾病严重程度方面具有可比性，降低选择偏倚，并为组间比较提供统计学基础。主要疗效比较依据随机分配的分组进行，采用治疗策略估计目标，受试者不因依从性、合并BPH用药或脱落而改变分组归属。","rationale":"正文依据已确认事实撰写：受试者于基线访视（V0）随机并首次给药，计划入组726例、每组363例，两组按1:1比例分配，研究为多中心平行组设计，主要疗效比较按随机分组、采用治疗策略估计目标。医学作者需核对随机化方案中的序列生成方法、区组与分层设置及分配隐藏规定后补全实施细节。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（随机化）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（估计目标、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_c5b834be5efb7ef5","section_number":"4.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:87ce7972b959cef0f3a2a8c8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fa51b8e0f4b0c3","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260929214156_6dd8e933","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_dcedb3760172c9fc:full-draft:87ce7972b959cef0f3a2a8c8","quote":"章节编号=4.4\n章节标题=盲法与揭盲\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=本研究采用双盲设计。","quote_sha256":"7662b497258064bbd4245f644e4ed5814057c21b795c4ccc2af9444ff504d348","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:87ce7972b959cef0f3a2a8c8","span_id":"ev_packet_44"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心III期确证性研究","quote_sha256":"b54023d287ba13d7e981a0107b17ac83e4cdc7d00339373c8b4b93062e32b7df","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"研究时期：筛选期（最长6周）；双盲治疗期（52周，每日口服一次）；安全性随访（末次给药后4周）","quote_sha256":"4352b78525b45e7b3a04dbe87ee30545ebe77f62e13d9575bc97d968339fc956","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂薄膜衣片QD×52周双盲双模拟；主要比较R3A-BPH101 50mg组 vs 安慰剂组第52周IPSS较基线变化。","quote_sha256":"e81e4ce8fda7d6251ddfcb3babaea0b23efe2179810564e4cf02f9879e6d9dd9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"剂量与给药方案：R3A-BPH101（口服β3肾上腺素受体激动剂）：50mg薄膜衣片QD整片吞服，连续52周；漏服当日不补服。","quote_sha256":"48704c5e115392299940f1e9dfc47b2c1e4e66bde83f65367c2d96e29e56ac8f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_dosing"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_packet_44","ev_design","ev_periods","ev_placebo","ev_dosing"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充本项目随机化与揭盲程序文件，明确揭盲与紧急揭盲的触发条件、实施方式、记录要求及揭盲后的处理安排","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_44_unblinding_procedure","missing_source_classes":["随机化与揭盲程序文件","紧急揭盲操作说明"],"target":"4.4 盲法与揭盲"}],"heading":"盲法与揭盲","missing_source_classes":["随机化与揭盲程序文件","紧急揭盲操作说明"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用双盲设计。受试者按1:1比例随机分配至R3A-BPH101 50mg组或安慰剂组；安慰剂组接受与研究药物相匹配的安慰剂薄膜衣片，两组给药方式均为每日口服一次、连续52周，采用双盲双模拟，在为期52周的双盲治疗期内维持盲态，以控制与治疗分配相关的偏倚。盲态维持与随机化分配共同构成本研究控制偏倚的核心设计要素，用以支持组间比较的可靠性。","rationale":"正文仅写入已确认事实：双盲设计、1:1随机分配、与研究药物匹配的安慰剂薄膜衣片、每日一次连续52周及双盲双模拟、双盲治疗期52周。医学作者需依据本项目随机化与揭盲程序文件确认揭盲及紧急揭盲相关内容后再行补充；盲态涉及的人员范围不在本章自行指定。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（盲法与揭盲）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_908230859b6c1b06","section_number":"4.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:87ce7972b959cef0f3a2a8c8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fa51b8e0f4b0c3","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260929214156_6dd8e933","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_dcedb3760172c9fc:full-draft:87ce7972b959cef0f3a2a8c8","quote":"章节编号=4.5\n章节标题=安全性审评/数据监查委员会\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=设置独立数据监查委员会（DMC）","quote_sha256":"b5dadf73e6e559a5ad58e31f2249c7326de26ecf867b169ea833b3a9be1c50c0","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:87ce7972b959cef0f3a2a8c8","span_id":"ev_packet_45"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"自适应设计是否计划：否\n样本量再估计是否计划：否\n期中分析是否计划：否\nSRC是否计划：否\nDMC是否计划：是","quote_sha256":"e10a8d8a6f45953940dc44db993ce4fb5844ebb3a5b49c85365d79e0b89c8c97","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_monitoring_flags"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE/SAE发生率与严重程度；实验室、心电图与生命体征；性功能相关AE（射精功能障碍、性欲减退）","quote_sha256":"ce4060d33136178a223a784d94a112f553639cbadea8dcd4898e2f6e211676f7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"研究时期：筛选期（最长6周）；双盲治疗期（52周，每日口服一次）；安全性随访（末次给药后4周）","quote_sha256":"4352b78525b45e7b3a04dbe87ee30545ebe77f62e13d9575bc97d968339fc956","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"主要终点ANCOVA（协变量：基线IPSS、中心分层），mITT主分析集；关键次要终点按固定顺序控制多重性；安全性按Safety集描述；补充混合模型与插补敏感性分析。","quote_sha256":"f9c8430d29555995e39fa34f1d7ff3f5250083ec500ab283321a153156add6dc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_analysis"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_packet_45","ev_monitoring_flags","ev_safety_endpoints","ev_periods","ev_analysis"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充DMC章程及相关操作文件，明确DMC组成、职责范围、会议安排、审评程序及其与申办者和研究者的沟通机制","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_45_dmc_charter","missing_source_classes":["DMC章程","DMC操作流程文件"],"target":"4.5 安全性审评/数据监查委员会"},{"action":"补充AE/SAE定义、采集与报告时限及流程，以及研究药物具体安全性风险信息来源，以支撑安全性审评相关内容","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_45_safety_reporting","missing_source_classes":["AE/SAE定义与报告程序文件","研究者手册（IB）中的研究药物安全性信息","药物警戒或安全性报告流程文件"],"target":"4.5 安全性审评/数据监查委员会（安全性报告程序）"}],"heading":"安全性审评/数据监查委员会","missing_source_classes":["DMC章程及操作流程文件","AE/SAE定义与报告程序文件","研究者手册（IB）中的研究药物安全性信息"],"proposal_text":"本研究设置独立数据监查委员会（DMC），承担独立的数据监查职能。研究不计划期中分析，不进行样本量再估计，也不采用自适应设计，不计划设置SRC。安全性审评覆盖双盲治疗期（52周，每日口服一次）及末次给药后4周的安全性随访期。安全性评价范围包括治疗中出现的不良事件（TEAE）与严重不良事件（SAE）的发生率与严重程度，实验室检查、心电图与生命体征，以及与性功能相关的AE（射精功能障碍、性欲减退）；安全性数据在Safety集进行描述性分析。","rationale":"正文依据已确认事实撰写：设置独立数据监查委员会（DMC），不计划期中分析、样本量再估计与自适应设计，不计划设置SRC，安全性审评覆盖52周双盲治疗期及末次给药后4周安全性随访期，安全性终点包括TEAE/SAE、实验室检查、心电图、生命体征及性功能相关AE，安全性数据按Safety集描述分析。医学作者需依据DMC章程与药物警戒文件核对DMC组成、职责、审评程序及AE/SAE报告规则。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_7299b34eef6658da","section_number":"4.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:87ce7972b959cef0f3a2a8c8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fa51b8e0f4b0c3","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"2f2894b9f18893e4486bab798340097cff614b9923a9b4adc164b3624f43d227","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_dcedb3760172c9fc:full-draft:87ce7972b959cef0f3a2a8c8","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:87ce7972b959cef0f3a2a8c8","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:f94942df2b54539a7bb61ed3d77887d5d31e6dfd7ae9f01e5fbb9073f52d3970:87ce7972b959cef0f3a2a8c8","text_sha256":"2f2894b9f18893e4486bab798340097cff614b9923a9b4adc164b3624f43d227"},{"content_sha256":"7d3e402d3cc3463c846cf6c10bdb2cccb5427e7182652e8266fbdf266f23755b","locator":"study_de